     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PnEFqSqIh00/Vo0rDDuSiFI/AAAAAAAAALY/cMIavEZexsk/s1600/%25E6%259C%25AA%25E5%2591%25BD%25E5%2590%258D.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PnEFqSqIh00/Vo0rDDuSiFI/AAAAAAAAALY/cMIavEZexsk/s1600/%2525E6%25259C%2525AA%2525E5%252591%2525BD%2525E5%252590%25258D.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238104822000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2DkkFd4aGjBkfpsUSIkcnd\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-PnEFqSqIh00/Vo0rDDuSiFI/AAAAAAAAALY/cMIavEZexsk/s400/%25E6%259C%25AA%25E5%2591%25BD%25E5%2590%258D.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"262\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><table border=\"0\" style=\"font-family:Arial,細明體;letter-spacing:1px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:navy\"><pre><span style=\"font-family:Arial,細明體;font-size:large\">KD指標相關公式如下:</span><br></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\"><br></font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\">           第n天收盤價-最近n天內最低價</font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\" style=\"font-family:Arial,細明體\">RSV ＝────────────────</font><span style=\"font-size:large;font-family:Arial,細明體\">───────</span><span style=\"font-size:large;font-family:Arial,細明體\">×100</span><font size=\"4\">\r\n</font></pre><pre style=\"font-size:11pt\"><font size=\"4\">         最近n天內最高價-最近n天內最低價</font></pre></td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:navy;font-size:11pt\"><br>計算出RSV之後，再來計算K值與D值。</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:navy;font-size:11pt\">當日K值(%K)= 2/3 前一日 K值 + 1/3 RSV</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:navy;font-size:11pt\">當日D值(%D)= 2/3 前一日 D值＋ 1/3 當日K值<br><br><br>目前程式碼如圖:<br><br>一.<br>     請問各位高手 圖中公式中元素之設定有錯誤否?<br>     尤其是&quot;n天內&quot;的程式碼表達方式。<br>二.<br>     從附檔之數據中 第一天之KD值會得不到，可否自行設定常數約50?<br><br>感謝大家， 小弟R語言新手...<br><br><br><br><br><br></td><td><br></td><td><br></td><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
